  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Активный сабвуфер Klipsch R-121SW — The R-121SW has an all-digital amplifier with volume, low-pass, phase and auto-power-on features.</p>\n<ul><li>Frequency range: 28Hz–120Hz</li><li>Maximum acoustic output: 118 dB</li><li>Amplifier power (continuous/peak): 200W/400W</li><li>Driver: 12-inch high-excursion spun-copper TCP woofer</li><li>Enclosure type: Bass-reflex via rear-firing port</li></ul>\n<h2>Характеристики</h2>\n<p><strong>Frequency range</strong>: 28Hz–120Hz · <strong>Maximum acoustic output</strong>: 118 dB · <strong>Amplifier power (continuous/peak)</strong>: 200W/400W · <strong>Driver</strong>: 12-inch high-excursion spun-copper TCP woofer · <strong>Enclosure type</strong>: Bass-reflex via rear-firing port · <strong>Inputs</strong>: Line-level/LFE RCA jacks · <strong>Dimensions (H×W×D)</strong>: 16.6 × 16.0 × 19.7 in (421 × 406 × 500 mm) · <strong>Weight</strong>: 35 lb (16.0 kg).</p>\n<p>Its MDF cabinet uses a bass-reflex design with a rear-firing port.</p>",
